   ["Ond dw i'n gwybod… bod angen i fi… barhau i ymarfer… os dw i moyn siarad… yn fwy hyderus.","But I know that I need to keep practising if I want to speak more confidently.","e81cd2ef-736b-45ce-abd1-a024bc8fbfe2.v2","00d31729-f936-4aeb-ac47-2ed142aed678",[7842,14212],null]
  ],
  "cym_s_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S008": [
   ["Dylet ti fod yn hyderus… yn barod.","You should be confident already.","f394b7e7-d6ae-438a-92c7-ce4b18f64b45","a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d",[0,2212],[0,2219],{"kFor":"a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d"}],
   ["Dw i'n meddwl… dy fod ti'n gwneud… yn llawer gwell… nag wyt ti'n sylweddoli.","I think you're doing much better than you realise.","f394b7e7-d6ae-438a-92c7-ce4b18f64b45","a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d",[2258,5406],[2379,5529],{"kFor":"a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d"}],
   ["Dw i'n… teimlo'n gyfforddus… yn siarad gyda ti,… a dw i ddim yn siarad… yn araf iawn.","I feel comfortable speaking with you, and I'm not talking very slowly.","f394b7e7-d6ae-438a-92c7-ce4b18f64b45","a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d",[5540,10054],[5817,10241],{"kFor":"a4416c01-f350-4d6e-ac85-fdf0f723ae4d"}]
  ],
  "cym_s_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S010": [
   ["Dw i'n meddwl… bod hynny'n normal.","I think that's normal.","cc014d2d-652e-475a-9d31-22d2f68cb0b1","66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322",[0,1770],[0,1682],{"kFor":"66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322"}],
   ["Mae dysgu iaith newydd… yn anodd.","Learning a new language is difficult.","cc014d2d-652e-475a-9d31-22d2f68cb0b1","66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322",[1827,3660],[1838,4381],{"kFor":"66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322"}],
   ["Ond mae'n gymaint o hwyl… pan wyt ti'n… dechrau cael sgyrsiau,… on'd yw e?","But it's so much fun when you start to have conversations, isn't it?","cc014d2d-652e-475a-9d31-22d2f68cb0b1","66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322",[3664,7080],[4647,8605],{"kFor":"66110261-13d6-4c01-b253-2f6e2c0d7322"}]
